LOCATION:Crescent Theater\, 208 Dauphin St\, Mobile\, AL
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/30 · 8:00 PM (doors 7:00 PM)\n\nThe Crescent Theater
  in downtown Mobile screens the silent horror classic Nosferatu while Mike
  Dillon\, Chris "Baby" Spies\, Brian Haas and James Singleton improvise a 
 score live. The theater lists the show as all ages. Doors open at 7:00 PM 
 ahead of the 8:00 PM start.\n\nPrice: from $39.01\n\nDetails: https://coas
 taleventures.com/events/ev-crescent-nosferatu-live-score-1030.html
